WEBVTT

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:22.080
Looking up at the purple panorama of the galaxy highway...

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:30.190
...a shooting star pierces my heart.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:38.000
synchronized with the sleepless city...
My accelerating heartbeat is

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:44.770
...and I suddenly pray for the unseen tomorrow...

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:50.010
...that brings that melody.

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:56.950
A mysterious voice won't let me go.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:03.560
Oh, tell me seventh moon, this frustrated heart...

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:09.330
...where will you take me to?

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:15.840
To sway in the blue seventh moon...

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:25.750
...searching for the answer to the rhythm in this crazy dance.

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:39.860
In the year 2009, humanity
encountered its first alien race.

00:01:39.860 --> 00:01:45.180
The result was an intergalactic war with a militaristic race of giants called Zentraedi.

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:47.640
The Earth was thrown into what
seemed a never-ending crisis.

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:51.830
In the year 2010, March,
the war was brought to an end.

00:01:51.830 --> 00:01:54.740
In April of the same year, the New Unity Government was established...

00:01:54.740 --> 00:01:58.690
...calling together mankind and Zentraedi into peaceful co-existence.

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:04.890
This resulted in a mass micronization of the remaining Zentraedi via the "Micron Process."

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:10.870
In September of 2011, the Unity Government devised a colonization plan...

00:02:10.870 --> 00:02:13.290
...centered upon the preservation
of the human race.

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:16.640
In September of the next year,
the first colonial transport...

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:18.400
...the Megaroad One
began its journey.

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:24.270
In September of 2030, the first of the new Macross-class transports...

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:28.390
...a gigantic vessel dwarfing its
Megaroad predecessor, departed Earth.

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:30.750
These ships could carry in
excess of one million people.

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:39.530
In 2038, the 37th colonial expedition, the
7th Macross fleet, launched from Earth orbit.

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:42.330
Its destination -- the Galactic Core.

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:44.910
It is now 2045...

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:49.440
It's Super Nova !
The Super Nova !

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:51.580
You really are a
hard nut to crack.

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:54.240
And you're just as stubborn.

00:02:55.100 --> 00:02:57.450
You've gotten much nicer
since the last time we met.

00:02:57.450 --> 00:02:59.640
I've changed a lot
since we were together.

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:03.860
Hey, knock it off !

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:04.820
What was that ?!

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:15.530
Damn ! Lord Gepelnitch
used me as a decoy !

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:25.530
VAMPIRE SOLDIER

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:35.080
Let's get started, it's Saturday night.
How're you guys doing ?

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:39.500
Let's stand up, do you feel the beat ?

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:47.250
This is a flying paradise.
A forgotten energy...

00:03:47.250 --> 00:03:51.810
Now hurry up and take it back.

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:55.990
No more wastin' time.

00:03:55.990 --> 00:04:06.100
Before everything fades away like a dream.

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:13.980
Hey, everybody ! Aim at the light.

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:19.820
Let's dance. Dancing on the planet dance.

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:27.130
A liar sings a sad song of surrender.

00:04:27.130 --> 00:04:31.330
No thanks ! You're of no help.

00:04:33.090 --> 00:04:39.100
Ever-changing constellations
and invisible sweat and tears...

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:43.630
...brings courage into my heart.

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:51.850
No more wastin' love, don't ruin your love.

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:57.640
Someone must be looking only at you.

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:05.860
Hey, everybody ! Straight from your heart...

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:12.920
Let's shout. Jumpin' on the planet dance.

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:38.030
Last night, two young people were attacked as they were driving on the highway.

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:41.050
The number of victims
now totals eight.

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:46.240
As of yet, authorities have been unable
to identify the perpetrators.

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:48.650
The horrible crimes
occurred in City Seven at...

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:51.900
It's become a dangerous world, right ?

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:58.710
They say it might be
caused by vampires.

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:00.480
That's the "Galaxy Sport," right ?

00:06:00.480 --> 00:06:01.820
It's always irresponsible.

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:04.780
But everybody's
talking about it.

00:06:04.780 --> 00:06:07.270
There's no such
thing as vampires.

00:06:07.270 --> 00:06:10.870
You aren't a dreamer, are you ?
You have no sense of delicacy.

00:06:12.860 --> 00:06:13.500
What ?

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:15.550
What's a dream ?!

00:06:15.550 --> 00:06:19.620
One of the victims was
attacked near the concert !

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:22.690
It's not my fault.

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:45.450
Doctor, what are these
people suffering from ?

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:52.280
Well, apparently, there doesn't seem to be any physical damage to any of the patients.

00:06:52.280 --> 00:06:55.480
In other words, you're implying
that nothing harmed them ?

00:06:55.480 --> 00:06:58.230
Except...
This is quite peculiar.

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:00.900
This is the first time I've encountered
such a case in my career.

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:02.020
Then, what's...

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:05.990
Why is the military here ?

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:08.750
This concerns me.

00:07:10.350 --> 00:07:13.630
The symptoms are similar to
those of the downed pilots, correct ?

00:07:13.630 --> 00:07:17.500
Yes, sir. Doctor Chiba examined them personally and there's no question about it.

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:18.630
I see...

00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:21.520
We've been infiltrated.

00:07:22.780 --> 00:07:25.190
Captain Max !
What is this ?

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:27.330
What's going on ?

00:07:28.020 --> 00:07:30.330
I'll give you
the details, Mayor Miria.

00:07:31.410 --> 00:07:34.040
I want to see the
battleroid more closely.

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:35.080
Okay.

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:45.660
I don't need any
special treatment.

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:51.920
In other words, enemy soldiers have
penetrated City Seven, correct ?

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:54.620
Didn't I say that ?

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:56.830
We can't come to any
other conclusions, I assume ?

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:59.730
Am I wrong
in assuming this ?

00:07:59.730 --> 00:08:02.030
The possibility of this being
the case should be considered...

00:08:02.030 --> 00:08:04.310
...but as I said, we don't
have enough solid evidence.

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:07.220
I think we already
have enough evidence.

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:11.950
How are you going
to deal with it ?

00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:15.430
If we don't take action now,
the number of victims will soar.

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:18.430
But right now we're
concentrating on analysis.

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:20.690
I will strengthen
patrols, of course.

00:08:23.240 --> 00:08:25.600
I guess we don't
have an alternative.

00:08:26.540 --> 00:08:30.190
I hope you do enough to
make up for your mistake.

00:08:31.250 --> 00:08:32.000
Miria !

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:34.680
Is there something else ?

00:08:35.820 --> 00:08:37.200
How's Mylene doing ?

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:40.350
She's joined some
strange band, and well...

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:44.500
...she must come home late
from concerts. Be careful.

00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:48.740
Don't worry about Mylene.

00:09:04.530 --> 00:09:09.630
According to reports from the raiding party, ADG, the mission is going as planned.

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:13.020
Very good.
Proceed with the next stage !

00:09:13.020 --> 00:09:13.630
Yes, sir !

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:15.390
Thanks, everyone !

00:09:15.960 --> 00:09:17.580
Please come to
our next concert !

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:20.030
It was fantastic !

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:22.070
All right...All right...

00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:29.390
OK ! We have the
entire day off tomorrow.

00:09:29.870 --> 00:09:35.780
Hey, listen ! You'd better practice more on that song where you come in late.

00:09:35.780 --> 00:09:38.630
When you come
in early, you mean.

00:09:38.630 --> 00:09:40.900
I'm playing
from the score.

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:43.930
You're the one
that's slow, Basara.

00:09:43.930 --> 00:09:45.780
You don't understand...

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:48.140
My tempo comes
from the heart.

00:09:48.140 --> 00:09:50.730
What are you talking about ?!
Where's our harmony, then ?

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:54.500
Mylene, we can talk about this tomorrow.
Be careful on your way home.

00:09:57.500 --> 00:09:59.780
Why don't you have
Basara escort you home ?

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:01.850
It might be dangerous for
you to be out there alone.

00:10:01.850 --> 00:10:04.100
That's okay.
I live close to here...

00:10:04.100 --> 00:10:08.450
...and if I run into any vampires, I'll make sure to have my picture taken with them.

00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:09.530
See ya.

00:10:11.030 --> 00:10:12.440
Here they are !

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:13.900
This is our chance !

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:16.620
Basara !
Please take these !

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:17.540
Mine, too.

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:19.830
Your concert
was wonderful !

00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:20.830
Oh, thanks.

00:10:20.830 --> 00:10:22.790
You were great !

00:10:23.100 --> 00:10:24.130
Can I have
your autograph ?!

00:10:24.130 --> 00:10:25.470
Me, too !

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:27.030
Basara's tall, right ?

00:10:27.030 --> 00:10:27.830
Thanks.
Basara's tall, right ?

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:30.590
Look ! That lady
is amazing, too !

00:10:30.590 --> 00:10:31.530
You're right !

00:10:47.730 --> 00:10:49.530
What do you want ?

00:10:49.530 --> 00:10:52.430
The Mayor is very
worried about you.

00:10:52.430 --> 00:10:56.860
She said that you should come home and stay there until the vampire mysteries are settled.

00:10:56.860 --> 00:10:59.800
Gimme a break !
This is none of your business !

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:02.680
And I don't need any bodyguards !
Now leave me alone !

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:04.540
But we can't do that.

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:06.380
You can, too !
See ya !

00:11:08.780 --> 00:11:10.130
Miss ! Wait !

00:11:10.880 --> 00:11:12.530
Geez !
Why should I ?!

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:14.780
Miss !

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:18.950
Wait, please !

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:21.330
Geez, they're persistent.

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:24.490
Miss !

00:11:28.030 --> 00:11:30.630
Miss !
Where are you ?

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:34.830
This is really
getting to me.

00:11:37.180 --> 00:11:38.330
What's wrong, Guvava ?

00:11:58.140 --> 00:11:59.140
Stop right there !

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:03.830
Come on !

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:04.830
Basara !

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:08.730
Why...?

00:12:10.130 --> 00:12:12.530
Because I saw those
strange guys following you.

00:12:20.970 --> 00:12:24.330
Spiritia Level Gauge
is extraordinarily high.

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:29.050
The high Spiritia Level is definitely
caused by fear. An amazing effect...

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:30.830
Who are they ?

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:33.080
I don't know.
They could be the vampires.

00:12:40.180 --> 00:12:41.030
Miss !

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:42.030
Who are they ?

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:43.870
They're supposed to
be my bodyguards.

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:46.530
Bodyguards ?

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:47.530
Sort of.

00:12:47.950 --> 00:12:48.620
Hey, you !

00:12:55.530 --> 00:12:57.370
What're you gonna do ?

00:13:00.730 --> 00:13:02.630
Look where you brought us !

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:03.930
No problem.

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:09.750
What're you trying to do ?
The vampires are coming !

00:13:18.410 --> 00:13:20.080
It stinks in here.

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:21.580
How do you
put up with it ?

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:22.630
I can't.

00:13:22.630 --> 00:13:23.880
But you look all right.

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:28.940
Weren't you planning on taking
a picture with the vampires ?

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:32.050
But...But I forgot to
bring a camera with me.

00:13:37.240 --> 00:13:37.780
Hey !

00:13:38.930 --> 00:13:40.550
Were you worried ?

00:13:40.550 --> 00:13:41.780
About what ?

00:13:41.780 --> 00:13:43.620
You were following me, right ?

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:45.090
Yeah.

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:46.620
Were you worried ?

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:47.620
About what ?

00:13:48.240 --> 00:13:49.580
About me ?

00:13:49.580 --> 00:13:51.500
It's dangerous for a
kid to walk home alone.

00:13:54.070 --> 00:13:55.790
I was also
worried about Guvava.

00:13:58.950 --> 00:13:59.950
Miss !

00:14:01.030 --> 00:14:04.840
You son of a bitch !  How could
you bring her to such a place ?!

00:14:05.330 --> 00:14:06.250
What ?

00:14:06.250 --> 00:14:07.310
No, he didn't...

00:14:09.650 --> 00:14:10.620
What're you doing ?!

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:14.380
Damn you !

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:15.930
I told you to stop !

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:17.930
But...

00:14:19.780 --> 00:14:20.730
They're here.

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:22.530
Shit !

00:14:29.880 --> 00:14:32.000
Stop it !
You'll hit her !

00:14:33.880 --> 00:14:35.450
You'd better take
care of her !

00:14:35.880 --> 00:14:38.060
Of course !
Make sure you get away, too !

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:46.260
You vampires
are dead meat !

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:51.040
Ouch !

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:52.730
Are you all right ?

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:54.390
I think it's twisted.

00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:02.390
Can you walk ?

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:08.010
Well, anyway...
Thank you.

00:15:08.930 --> 00:15:12.110
Why don't you admit
you need a bodyguard ?

00:15:12.110 --> 00:15:14.930
Gimme a break !
They're too overprotective.

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:17.380
But they have their orders.

00:15:17.380 --> 00:15:19.530
I didn't request them.

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:20.930
Oh, whatever...

00:15:22.130 --> 00:15:28.420
Listen. You may not understand,
but I ran away from home once.

00:15:28.420 --> 00:15:32.330
I can't ask for any help
just because I get in trouble.

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:37.350
I hate being uncertain !

00:15:38.280 --> 00:15:39.230
I see.

00:15:44.600 --> 00:15:47.600
Enemy craft has folded out
within the red line.

00:15:49.660 --> 00:15:54.560
They must have highly skilled techniques, because they folded out so close to us.

00:15:55.450 --> 00:15:58.140
They have two sided operations,
inner and outer.

00:15:58.140 --> 00:15:59.230
Defense shell down !

00:15:59.230 --> 00:15:59.880
Yes, sir !

00:16:19.820 --> 00:16:20.980
What are you doing ?

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:21.980
That hurt !

00:16:24.630 --> 00:16:25.780
Are you all right ?

00:16:25.780 --> 00:16:27.000
I'm fine.

00:16:29.180 --> 00:16:30.350
I'm sorry.

00:16:30.350 --> 00:16:31.530
Why ?

00:16:33.950 --> 00:16:36.140
Listen !
That sounds like an alarm.

00:16:37.630 --> 00:16:40.270
The enemy could
be attacking.

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:41.250
Probably.

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:43.930
Hey !

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:47.110
Do you want to go ?

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:48.120
Where ?

00:16:48.120 --> 00:16:49.550
To sing a song ?

00:16:52.270 --> 00:16:53.010
Hey !

00:16:53.010 --> 00:16:53.930
What ?!

00:16:54.690 --> 00:16:57.360
You can go.
I'm alright.

00:16:57.360 --> 00:16:58.800
I don't think so.

00:16:58.800 --> 00:16:59.970
I'm fine !

00:16:59.970 --> 00:17:01.330
No you're not !

00:17:19.480 --> 00:17:20.830
You go on ahead !

00:17:20.830 --> 00:17:23.260
I'll be okay because
we're far enough away.

00:17:23.260 --> 00:17:24.760
Oh, shut up !

00:17:24.760 --> 00:17:26.560
I'll go to Ray's place.

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:28.800
Then we're going
to the same place.

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:32.600
What're you doing ?
Basara !

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:37.300
Shell closing. The ship will
be enclosed in 270 seconds.

00:17:37.930 --> 00:17:39.290
Diamond Force, launch !

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:43.130
Yes, sir ! Diamond Force, away !
Catapult rising.

00:17:43.730 --> 00:17:45.430
Angel leader to A3...

00:17:45.430 --> 00:17:47.730
D1 to
D2 and D3 !

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:50.730
Don't let the enemy get by.
Intercept formation D !

00:17:50.730 --> 00:17:51.450
Yes, sir !

00:17:56.420 --> 00:17:57.460
Cannon fodder !

00:18:05.330 --> 00:18:06.730
Spread out and
attack at will !

00:18:07.130 --> 00:18:08.130
Yes, sir !

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:10.470
I won't let you
advance any farther !

00:18:16.720 --> 00:18:18.610
Physica ! He went
that way ! He's yours !

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:19.530
Yes, sir !

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:22.490
I got him !

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:44.930
It's him...

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:48.530
It's that guy !

00:18:53.310 --> 00:18:54.530
Let's do it !

00:18:55.730 --> 00:19:03.240
Let's go and run into the morning glow,
that we once dreamed of.

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:06.660
It's still far away though...

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:13.530
Maybe, it'll be alright if we
keep our love all the time.

00:19:13.530 --> 00:19:13.860
Damn, you ! You're in the way !
Maybe, it'll be alright if we
keep our love all the time.

00:19:13.860 --> 00:19:15.780
If you listen to my song...
Damn, you ! You're in the way !

00:19:15.780 --> 00:19:17.450
Get out of here ! Withdraw !
If you listen to my song...

00:19:17.450 --> 00:19:17.550
If you listen to my song...

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:20.470
...it's so easy to...

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:25.360
...cross a heart with another.

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:26.070
My heart of love soars into the night sky,
carrying my burning emotions.

00:19:26.070 --> 00:19:29.030
Shell down will be completed in 152 seconds.

00:19:29.030 --> 00:19:31.710
My heart of love soars into the night sky,
carrying my burning emotions.

00:19:31.710 --> 00:19:32.720
Keep shooting down sadness and anger.

00:19:32.720 --> 00:19:33.350
Now !
Keep shooting down sadness and anger.

00:19:33.350 --> 00:19:34.720
Keep shooting down sadness and anger.

00:19:34.720 --> 00:19:35.450
Shit !
Keep shooting down sadness and anger.

